# Author order confirmed by the authors. ORCIDs of Scott Imig and Phan Thanh Duc to be added.
# The MIT license covers the code; third-party data in data/ keep their own terms (DATA.md).
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or data, please cite it using the metadata in this file,
  and cite the accompanying paper.
title: >-
  Same Cluster, Different Wallet: Cluster Dependence in Airdrop Sybil Detection,
  Evidence from the LayerZero Airdrop — code and data
type: software
version: "2.0-revision"
license: MIT
authors:
  - given-names: Thuat
    family-names: Do
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8156-6983"
  - given-names: Scott
    family-names: Imig
  - given-names: Thanh Duc
    family-names: Phan
repository-code: "https://github.com/paven86/layerzero_xgboost"
abstract: >-
  Code and input data that train and evaluate XGBoost, LightGBM, random forest and
  logistic regression classifiers, and a cross-model ensemble, on 434,786 Ethereum
  addresses to identify Sybil wallets in the LayerZero airdrop of June 2024, using
  62 transaction and gas provision network features, evaluated on stratified group
  splits by gas provision tree, with every result traced to one commit.
keywords:
  - Sybil detection
  - airdrop
  - LayerZero
  - Ethereum
  - gas provision network
  - XGBoost
